$$SYNTAX-LEVEL 2
*(mgdb-gene
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
<meta name="twitter:site" content="@MaizeGDB">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://maizegdb.org/gene_center/gene">
<meta property="og:title" content="MaizeGDB Gene Data Hub | Maize Genes and Gene Models">
<meta property="og:description" content="Search maize genes and gene models by name, identifier, sequence or position, translate identifiers between annotations, and download gene model sets.">

<main class="mgdb-page mgdb-hub-page mgdb-gene-page" id="gene-top">

  <nav class="mgdb-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/data_center">Data hubs</a><span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span><span aria-current="page">Genes</span>
  </nav>

  <section class="mgdb-hero" aria-labelledby="gene-title">
    <div class="mgdb-hero-emblem">
      <img src="/images/quicklinks/gene_center.png" alt="" width="128" height="128" decoding="async" />
      <strong>Gene<br />Data Hub</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="mgdb-hero-body">
      <p class="mgdb-hero-stamp"><span aria-hidden="true">&#9679;</span> Updated&#58; $(built_date)</p>
      <h1 id="gene-title">Maize genes and gene models</h1>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-description">$(total_gene_models) gene models from $(total_annotations) current annotations of $(total_lines) maize lines, including the $(reference_models) gene models of the B73 reference annotation $(reference_annotation). $(curated_loci) gene loci carry a curated gene symbol.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="mgdb-section-tabs" aria-label="Sections on this page">
    <a href="#gene-search" class="is-current" aria-current="true">Search</a>
    <a href="#gene-region">Sequence and region</a>
    <a href="#gene-lists">Gene model lists</a>
    <a href="#gene-downloads">Downloads</a>
    <a href="#gene-nomenclature">Nomenclature</a>
    <a href="#gene-about">About</a>
    <a href="#gene-references">References</a>
    <a href="#gene-metrics">Metrics</a>
    <a href="#gene-related">Related resources</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- ==================================================================
       1. Search
       ================================================================== -->
  <section id="gene-search" aria-labelledby="gene-search-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="gene-search-title">Search</h2></div>
    </div>

    <div class="gene-search-intro">
      <div><h3>Which gene are you looking for?</h3><p>A locus name, gene model ID, transcript ID, translation ID, gene symbol or gene name, whole or partial. Retired gene models are searched too, so an identifier that returns nothing here was never in a MaizeGDB annotation.</p></div>
    </div>

    <form id="gene-search-form" class="mgdb-search" role="search">
      <div class="mgdb-field gene-query-field">
        <label class="mgdb-label" for="gene-search-term">Locus, gene model, transcript or translation</label>
        <div class="gene-query-line">
          <input class="mgdb-input" id="gene-search-term" name="term" type="search" placeholder="Zm00001eb067740" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="gene-search-hint" />
          <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary gene-search-submit" type="submit">Search</button>
          <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-quiet gene-search-reset" type="reset" id="gene-search-reset">Reset</button>
        </div>
        <p class="mgdb-hint" id="gene-search-hint">Wildcards&#58; <code>^lg1</code> starts with, <code>lg1$</code> ends with, <code>*</code> anywhere.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gene-search-options" aria-label="Search options">
        <div class="mgdb-field">
          <label class="mgdb-label" for="gene-search-limit">Maximum records</label>
          <select class="mgdb-select" id="gene-search-limit" name="limit">
            <option value="50">50</option>
            <option value="100" selected>100</option>
            <option value="250">250</option>
            <option value="500">500</option>
            <option value="1000">1,000</option>
            <option value="$(search_limit_max)">$(search_limit_max_label)</option>
          </select>
          <p class="mgdb-hint">The most rows a single search returns.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="mgdb-hint gene-examples">
        <span>Examples&#58;</span>
        <button type="button" class="gene-example" data-term="lg1">lg1</button>
        <button type="button" class="gene-example" data-term="liguleless1">liguleless1</button>
        <button type="button" class="gene-example" data-term="Zm00001eb067740">Zm00001eb067740</button>
        <button type="button" class="gene-example" data-term="GRMZM2G036297">GRMZM2G036297</button>
        <button type="button" class="gene-example" data-term="DAA35605">DAA35605</button>
        <button type="button" class="gene-example" data-term="Zm00001d002005_T001">Zm00001d002005_T001</button>
        <button type="button" class="gene-example" data-term="^lg1">^lg1</button>
        <button type="button" class="gene-example" data-term="lg1$">lg1$</button>
      </p>
    </form>

    <div class="gene-results-head">
      <p id="gene-results-status" aria-live="polite">Enter a locus name or an identifier to search $(total_gene_models) gene models.</p>
      <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-quiet" id="gene-export-tsv" href="#" download hidden>Export TSV</a>
    </div>

    <div id="gene-notes"></div>
    <div id="gene-results"></div>

    <div class="mgdb-empty" id="gene-empty" hidden>
      <h3>No genes or gene models matched</h3>
      <p>Check the spelling of the identifier, try a synonym, or search the <a href="/data_center/locus">Locus Data Hub</a> for classic genetic loci that carry no gene model. Retired gene models are searched too, so an identifier that returns nothing here was never in a MaizeGDB annotation.</p>
    </div>

    <details class="gene-advanced" id="gene-advanced">
      <summary><span class="gene-advanced-title">Advanced search</span></summary>
      <p class="gene-advanced-intro">Check the boxes next to the fields you want to search; if you just want to find records that have <i>any</i> value for that attribute, check the box and leave the criteria alone.</p>

      <form id="gene-advanced-form" class="gene-advanced-form">
        <p class="gene-advanced-lead">Show only genes:</p>

        <div class="gene-criterion">
          <input type="checkbox" id="adv-annotation-box" />
          <label for="adv-annotation-box">from this <b>annotation</b></label>
          <select class="mgdb-select" id="adv-annotation" aria-label="Annotation">
            <option value="all">All annotations</option>
            $(annotation_options)
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="gene-criterion">
          <input type="checkbox" id="adv-type-box" />
          <label for="adv-type-box">of this <b>type</b></label>
          <select class="mgdb-select" id="adv-type" aria-label="Gene model type">
            <option value="all">All types</option>
            $(model_type_options)
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="gene-criterion">
          <input type="checkbox" id="adv-chr-box" />
          <label for="adv-chr-box">on this <b>chromosome</b></label>
          <select class="mgdb-select" id="adv-chr" aria-label="Chromosome">
            <option value="all">All chromosomes</option>
            <option value="Chr1">chromosome 1</option>
            <option value="Chr2">chromosome 2</option>
            <option value="Chr3">chromosome 3</option>
            <option value="Chr4">chromosome 4</option>
            <option value="Chr5">chromosome 5</option>
            <option value="Chr6">chromosome 6</option>
            <option value="Chr7">chromosome 7</option>
            <option value="Chr8">chromosome 8</option>
            <option value="Chr9">chromosome 9</option>
            <option value="Chr10">chromosome 10</option>
            <option value="Unplaced">Unplaced</option>
            <option value="ChrMt">Mitochondrial</option>
            <option value="ChrPt">Plastid</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="gene-criterion">
          <input type="checkbox" id="adv-range-box" />
          <label for="adv-range-box">between these positions</label>
          <div class="gene-criterion-controls">
            <input class="mgdb-input gene-input-short" type="text" id="adv-range-start" inputmode="numeric" aria-label="Start position" />
            <span class="gene-criterion-join">and</span>
            <input class="mgdb-input gene-input-short" type="text" id="adv-range-end" inputmode="numeric" aria-label="End position" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gene-criterion">
          <input type="checkbox" id="adv-locus-box" />
          <label for="adv-locus-box">associated with a <b>gene locus</b></label>
        </div>

        <div class="gene-criterion">
          <input type="checkbox" id="adv-product-box" />
          <label for="adv-product-box">that produce this <b>gene product</b></label>
          <select class="mgdb-select" id="adv-product" aria-label="Gene product" data-gene-options="gene_product">
            <option value="all">Any gene product</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="gene-criterion">
          <input type="checkbox" id="adv-pheno-box" />
          <label for="adv-pheno-box">that have this <b>phenotype</b></label>
          <select class="mgdb-select" id="adv-pheno" aria-label="Phenotype" data-gene-options="phenotype">
            <option value="0">Any phenotype</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="gene-criterion">
          <input type="checkbox" id="adv-trait-box" />
          <label for="adv-trait-box">that are associated with this <b>trait</b></label>
          <select class="mgdb-select" id="adv-trait" aria-label="Trait" data-gene-options="trait">
            <option value="0">Any trait</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="gene-criterion">
          <input type="checkbox" id="adv-tandem-box" />
          <label for="adv-tandem-box">that belong to a tandem array</label>
        </div>

        <div class="gene-criterion">
          <input type="checkbox" id="adv-protein-box" />
          <label for="adv-protein-box">associated with this protein or enzyme</label>
          <div class="gene-criterion-controls">
            <input class="mgdb-input gene-input-medium" type="text" id="adv-protein" aria-label="Protein or enzyme accession" aria-describedby="adv-protein-hint" />
            <span class="gene-criterion-join" id="adv-protein-hint">UniProt, PFam or EC</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mgdb-form-actions">
          <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" type="submit">Search</button>
          <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-quiet" type="reset">Clear</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="gene-advanced-notes"></div>
      <div id="gene-advanced-results"></div>
    </details>
  </section>

  

  <!-- ==================================================================
       3. Search by region
       ================================================================== -->
  <section id="gene-region" aria-labelledby="gene-region-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="gene-region-title">Sequence and region</h2></div>
    </div>
    <p class="gene-section-lead">Find gene models by the sequence they contain, by a stretch of a genome assembly, or by a list of intervals &#8212; and go the other way, from a list of gene models to their coordinates.</p>

    <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading">BLAST a sequence</h3>
    <form id="gene-blast-form" class="gene-panel" action="/search/gene/gene_seq_search.php" method="POST">
      <p class="gene-panel-lead">Enter up to 5 sequences, Genbank IDs or gene model names \(Zmdddddadddddd, ZEAMMB73_xxxx or GRMZMxxxxxx\):</p>

      <div class="mgdb-search-row">
        <div class="mgdb-field">
          <span class="mgdb-label" id="gene-blast-type-label">Sequence type</span>
          <div class="gene-radio-row" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="gene-blast-type-label">
            <label><input type="radio" name="seq_type" value="nucleotide" checked /> Nucleotide</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="seq_type" value="aminoacid" /> Amino acid</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-field">
          <label class="mgdb-label" for="gene-blast-target">Target dataset</label>
          <select class="mgdb-select" name="targets[]" id="gene-blast-target">
            <option value="">Select a target dataset</option>
            $(blast_options)
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mgdb-field">
        <label class="mgdb-label" for="gene-blast-sequence">Sequence</label>
        <textarea class="mgdb-textarea" name="sequence" id="gene-blast-sequence" rows="8"></textarea>
      </div>

      <input type="hidden" name="a" value="START_BLAST" />
      <input type="hidden" name="max_evalue" value="1e-7" />
      <input type="hidden" name="max_hits" value="100" />

      <div class="mgdb-form-actions">
        <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" type="submit">Submit</button>
        <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-quiet" type="button" data-gene-fill="gene-blast-sequence" data-gene-value="Zm00001d002005">Sample</button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading mgdb-spaced">Search by region</h3>

    <form id="gene-region-form" class="gene-panel" method="get" target="_blank" action="/search/gene/gene_chr_position.php">
      <fieldset class="gene-fieldset">
        <legend class="mgdb-label">Define the region by</legend>

        <div class="gene-region-choice">
          <label class="gene-region-radio">
            <input type="radio" name="region" id="region-assembly" value="assembly" checked />
            <span>assembly coordinates</span>
          </label>

          <div class="gene-region-fields" data-region="assembly">
            <div class="mgdb-search-row">
              <div class="mgdb-field">
                <label class="mgdb-label" for="region-gm-version">Annotation</label>
                <select class="mgdb-select" name="gm_version" id="region-gm-version">
                  $(annotation_options)
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="mgdb-field">
                <label class="mgdb-label" for="region-chr">Chromosome</label>
                <select class="mgdb-select" name="chr" id="region-chr">
                  <option value="chr1">Chromosome 1</option>
                  <option value="chr2">Chromosome 2</option>
                  <option value="chr3">Chromosome 3</option>
                  <option value="chr4">Chromosome 4</option>
                  <option value="chr5">Chromosome 5</option>
                  <option value="chr6">Chromosome 6</option>
                  <option value="chr7">Chromosome 7</option>
                  <option value="chr8">Chromosome 8</option>
                  <option value="chr9">Chromosome 9</option>
                  <option value="chr10">Chromosome 10</option>
                  <option value="UNKNOWN">Unmapped</option>
                  <option value="chrMt">Mitochondria</option>
                  <option value="chrPt">Chloroplast</option>
                  <option value="chrAll">All</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mgdb-search-row">
              <div class="mgdb-field">
                <label class="mgdb-label" for="region-model-type">Model type</label>
                <select class="mgdb-select" name="model_type" id="region-model-type">
                  <option value="any">any</option>
                  <option value="protein_coding">Protein Coding</option>
                  <option value="miRNA">miRNA</option>
                  <option value="transposable_element">Transposable Element</option>
                  <option value="low_confidence">Low Confidence</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="mgdb-field">
                <label class="mgdb-label" for="region-data-type">Data type</label>
                <select class="mgdb-select" name="data_type" id="region-data-type">
                  <option value="all">All Genes/Gene Models</option>
                  <option value="canonical">Canonical Transcripts</option>
                  <option value="genes">Only Gene Models Linked to Genes</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mgdb-search-row">
              <div class="mgdb-field">
                <label class="mgdb-label" for="region-start">Start position</label>
                <input class="mgdb-input" type="text" name="start_pos" id="region-start" inputmode="numeric" />
              </div>
              <div class="mgdb-field">
                <label class="mgdb-label" for="region-end">End position</label>
                <input class="mgdb-input" type="text" name="end_pos" id="region-end" inputmode="numeric" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mgdb-hint">\(enter positions w/o commas or spaces, or leave both empty for entire chromosome\)</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gene-region-choice">
          <label class="gene-region-radio">
            <input type="radio" name="region" id="region-marker" value="marker" />
            <span>marker</span>
          </label>

          <div class="gene-region-fields" data-region="marker">
            <div class="mgdb-search-row">
              <div class="mgdb-field">
                <label class="mgdb-label" for="region-start-marker">Start</label>
                <input class="mgdb-input" type="text" name="start_marker" id="region-start-marker" />
              </div>
              <div class="mgdb-field">
                <label class="mgdb-label" for="region-end-marker">End</label>
                <input class="mgdb-input" type="text" name="end_marker" id="region-end-marker" />
              </div>
              <div class="mgdb-field">
                <label class="mgdb-label" for="region-assembly-select">Assembly</label>
                <select class="mgdb-select" name="assembly" id="region-assembly-select">
                  $(annotation_options)
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mgdb-hint">Enter two markers to get gene models within the span. Both must be on the same chromosome. Only applicable for assemblies with aligned markers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gene-region-choice">
          <label class="gene-region-radio">
            <input type="radio" name="region" id="region-gm" value="gm" />
            <span>Assembly Annotation Positions</span>
          </label>

          <div class="gene-region-fields" data-region="gm">
            <div class="mgdb-field">
              <label class="mgdb-label" for="region-gm-list">Enter List - 8,000 gene model limit</label>
              <textarea class="mgdb-textarea" name="gm_pos_list" id="region-gm-list" rows="8"></textarea>
              <p class="mgdb-hint">Enter a list of gene models, transcripts, and/or proteins to retrieve their physical coordinates. <button type="button" class="gene-example" data-gene-fill="region-gm-list" data-gene-example="mixed">Example list</button></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <div class="mgdb-form-actions">
        <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" type="submit">Submit</button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading mgdb-spaced">Find gene models by position</h3>
    <form id="gene-bulk-position-form" class="gene-panel" method="POST" target="_blank" action="/search/gene/gene_bulk_position.php">
      <div class="mgdb-field">
        <label class="mgdb-label" for="bulk-positions">Positions</label>
        <p class="mgdb-hint" id="bulk-positions-hint">Enter one or more lines in comma-separated format with the columns&#58; <i>[chromosome]:[start]..[end]</i> Limit the number of positions to 100 or fewer.</p>
        <textarea class="mgdb-textarea" name="bulk_positions" id="bulk-positions" rows="6" aria-describedby="bulk-positions-hint"></textarea>
      </div>
      <div class="mgdb-field gene-field-narrow">
        <label class="mgdb-label" for="bulk-position-assembly">in this assembly</label>
        <select class="mgdb-select" name="bulk_position_assembly" id="bulk-position-assembly">
          <option value=""></option>
          $(position_options)
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="mgdb-form-actions">
        <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" type="submit">Submit</button>
        <button type="button" class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-quiet" data-gene-fill="bulk-positions" data-gene-example="positions">Example</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================================================================
       4. Gene model lists
       ================================================================== -->
  <section id="gene-lists" aria-labelledby="gene-lists-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="gene-lists-title">Gene model lists</h2></div>
    </div>

    <div class="gene-tool-grid">

      <form id="gene-translate-form" class="gene-panel" method="post" target="_blank" action="/search/gene/gene_translate.php">
        <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading">Translate Gene Model IDs</h3>
        <div class="mgdb-field">
          <label class="mgdb-label" for="translate-list">Enter list - 8,000 gene model limit</label>
          <textarea class="mgdb-textarea" name="gm_list" id="translate-list" rows="8"></textarea>
          <p class="mgdb-hint"><button type="button" class="gene-example" data-gene-fill="translate-list" data-gene-example="mixed">Example list</button></p>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-field">
          <label class="mgdb-label" for="translate-to">Translate to</label>
          <select class="mgdb-select" name="trans_to" id="translate-to">
            <option value="all">All gene sets</option>
            <option value="B73">All B73 gene sets</option>
            <option value="NAM">All NAM founders</option>
            <option value="genbank_gene">GenBank Gene accessions \(Entrez\)</option>
            <option value="genbank_id">GenBank protein accessions \(ZEAMMB*\)</option>
            $(assembly_options)
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-form-actions">
          <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" type="submit">Submit</button>
        </div>
        <p class="mgdb-small">Alternatively, <a href="https://download.maizegdb.org/Pan-genes/Pan-Zea">download the full gene model associations table between the B73 assemblies and all other assemblies in our database.</a></p>
      </form>

      <form id="gene-fasta-form" class="gene-panel" method="post" target="_blank" action="/search/gene/get_fasta.php">
        <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading">Download sequence for a gene model list</h3>
        <p class="gene-panel-lead">When downloading sequence please specify which type of input you are entering. For genomic please use the gene model name \(e.g. Zm00001eb067740\). For cDNA, CDS, and mRNA please use the transcript ID \(e.g. Zm00001eb067740_T001\). For protein please use the translation ID \(e.g. Zm00001eb067740_P001\). If you enter only the gene model ID, please choose if you want to see all transcripts or only the canonical transcripts.</p>
        <div class="mgdb-field">
          <label class="mgdb-label" for="fasta-list">Enter list - 8,000 gene model limit</label>
          <textarea class="mgdb-textarea" name="gm_seq_list" id="fasta-list" rows="8"></textarea>
          <p class="mgdb-hint"><button type="button" class="gene-example" data-gene-fill="fasta-list" data-gene-example="models">Example list</button></p>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-search-row">
          <div class="mgdb-field">
            <label class="mgdb-label" for="fasta-in-type">Input type</label>
            <select class="mgdb-select" name="in_type" id="fasta-in-type">
              <option value="gene">Gene Model ID</option>
              <option value="transcript">Transcript ID</option>
              <option value="translation">Translation ID</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="mgdb-field">
            <label class="mgdb-label" for="fasta-out-type">Output type</label>
            <select class="mgdb-select" name="out_type" id="fasta-out-type">
              <option value="genomic">Sequence: genomic</option>
              <option value="cdna">Sequence: cDNA - all transcripts</option>
              <option value="cdna-canonical">Sequence: cDNA - canonical transcripts</option>
              <option value="ncrna">Sequence: ncRNA</option>
              <option value="protein">Sequence: protein</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-form-actions">
          <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" type="submit">Submit</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <form id="gene-scores-form" class="gene-panel" method="post" target="_blank" action="/search/gene/get_scores.php">
        <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading">Get scores for a set of gene models</h3>
        <div class="mgdb-field">
          <label class="mgdb-label" for="scores-list">Enter one or more B73v5 or NAM gene model names</label>
          <textarea class="mgdb-textarea" name="bulk_score_gms" id="scores-list" rows="6"></textarea>
          <p class="mgdb-hint"><button type="button" class="gene-example" data-gene-fill="scores-list" data-gene-example="scores">Example</button></p>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-form-actions">
          <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" type="submit">Submit</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <form id="gene-downloadall-form" class="gene-panel" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
        <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading">Download all data for a list of gene models</h3>
        <p class="gene-panel-lead">Enter a list of B73 gene models, separated by newlines, commas, spaces, or semicolons.</p>
        <div class="mgdb-message mgdb-message-info" role="note">
          <div>Note: this can take several minutes, even for a short list of gene models.</div>
        </div>
        <input type="hidden" id="downloadall_job_id" />
        <input type="hidden" name="MAX_FILE_SIZE" value="30000" />
        <div class="mgdb-field">
          <label class="mgdb-label" for="downloadall_list">Enter a list of gene models</label>
          <textarea class="mgdb-textarea" id="downloadall_list" rows="8"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-field">
          <label class="mgdb-label" for="downloadall_file">Or upload a file</label>
          <input type="file" name="downloadall_file" id="downloadall_file" aria-describedby="downloadall-file-hint" />
          <p class="mgdb-hint" id="downloadall-file-hint">\(Maximum file size is 50kb\)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-form-actions">
          <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" type="submit">Submit</button>
          <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-quiet" type="reset">Reset</button>
        </div>
        <div id="downloadall_status_div" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <p class="mgdb-small">To download data from <i>all</i> gene models in a B73 assembly, use the links below:</p>
        <ul class="gene-link-list">
          <li><a href="https://download.maizegdb.org/B73_RefGen_v3/B73_RefGen_v3-GMs-GOTerms.csv.gz">B73 RefGen_v3 gene model data</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://download.maizegdb.org/Zm-B73-REFERENCE-GRAMENE-4.0/Zm-B73-REFERNECE-GRAMENE-4.0-GMs-GOTerms.csv.gz">Zm-B73-REFERENCE-GRAMENE-4.0 gene model data</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://download.maizegdb.org/Zm-B73-REFERENCE-NAM-5.0/Zm-B73-REFERENCE-NAM-5.0-GMs-GOTerms.csv.gz">Zm-B73-REFERENCE-NAM-5.0 gene model data</a></li>
        </ul>
      </form>

    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-resource-panel mgdb-spaced gene-maizemine">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading">MaizeMine</h3>
        <p><a href="https://maizemine.rnet.missouri.edu/maizemine/begin.do">MaizeMine</a> provides an alternative view into the MaizeGDB data, with an emphasis on genomic, gene expression data, and metabolics.</p>
        <p>The "Quick Search" feature on the <a href="https://maizemine.rnet.missouri.edu/maizemine/begin.do">MaizeMine home page</a> gives quick access to individual gene models, pathways, proteins, et cetera.</p>
        <p>To get data associated with a set of gene models, for example expression levels, pathways, GO terms, start by <a href="https://maizemine.rnet.missouri.edu/maizemine/bag.do?subtab=upload">creating a list</a>. Then you can attach data and analyze the list in multiple ways.</p>
        <p>You can see the list of data sources <a href="https://maizemine.rnet.missouri.edu/maizemine/dataCategories.do">here</a>. The MaizeMine tutorial is <a href="https://maizemine.readthedocs.io/en/v1.4/">here</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gene-maizemine-mark">
        <img src="/images/maizemine.png" alt="MaizeMine" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

