      <p>See the paper for B73 RefGen_v1 <a href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1126/science.1178534">here</a>, and for Zm-B73-REFERENCE-GRAMENE-4.0 <a href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1038/nature22971">here</a>.</p>
      <p><b>Annotations:</b> <a href="https://download.maizegdb.org/Zm-B73-REFERENCE-NAM-5.0">Zm00001eb.1</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genome/annotation_euk/Zea_mays/103">NCBI 103</a></p>
